        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 1571, 1.5 x 11 Arched Concord Multi Point Handleset with European Cylinder Below Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Concord European Cylinder Multi-Point Trim with 3-5/8 Inch c.c. is 1-1/2 inches wide and 11 inches tall. It is part of Emtek's multi point configuration # 5 collection, which is suitable for use on Peachtree brand patio doors. This traditional patio door multi-point handleset has a European Style cylinder below the handle.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis multipoint trim set is intended to replace the trim from Peachtree brand patio doors. The lock to lever distance is 3-5/8\" (92 mm). <b>This set does not come packaged with the multipoint lock mechanism</b> (the vertical rods found in multipoint patio doors that secure the door to the frame) as those are typically preinstalled in multipoint doors and cannot be replaced.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Keyed Entry:</b> Active levers both sides of door. Keyed lock cylinder outside with thumb turn inside to lock door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles, Two (2) cylinder collars, One (1) European profile cylinder with key outside & thumb turn inside and mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Concord Multi Point Trim with Door Configuration #5:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance Between Trim and Cylinder or Thumbturn: 3-5/8\"</li> \r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-5/8\" - 2-3/4\" please specify.</li>\r\n<li>Solid steel spindle.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
